docs/dogfood/2026-10-19-BI-30/transcripts/01a15269-9ac9-7008-b957-786c4a8a6902.jsonl:93:{"kind":"entry","v":1,"entry":{"id":"01a15271-30c6-790d-a820-0d22fef64b54","parentId":"01a15270-d3b0-7f44-93a6-d3248ad71289","type":"assistant","payload":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"## BI-30.1 断点续作完成\n\n### 改动文件清单（本工单）\n\n| 文件 | 改动 |\n|---|---|\n| `packages/tui/src/mount/agent-tui.ts` | `TuiSessionOptions.slashCommand` → `(line) => Promise<string \\| { prompt: string }>`；`submit()` 分流：`string` 走既有 `#transcribe(\"system\")` 本地回执（不入模型/JSONL，`endedAs=\"finish\"`）；`{ prompt }` 改写 `turnPrompt` 落下方普通模型回合（JSONL 记 user+assistant、转录 `[user]/[assistant]`、无 system 行）；doc 注释同步两形态语义 |\n| `bin/bi.ts` | 保留 `discovered.commands` 完整注册表 `customCommands: readonly SlashCommand[]`（发现失败=空表）；执行面：`/permissions` 语义不变 → 已知自定义命令按名取对象、参数体按空白切 `argv` → `expandCommand(command, argv)` → `ok` 返回 `{ prompt: expanded.text }`、`!ok` 返回 `expanded.error.message`；未知/内置候选的本地应答不变 |\n| `packages/tui/src/mount/agent-tui.test.ts` | 前任新增的 3 条 BI-30.1 用例（+154 行）经验证真实跑通：`{prompt}` 入模型回合（model 收到展开文本\"总结: 日志\"、转录无 `[system]` 行、JSONL `[user, assistant]`、`endedAs=\"finish\"`）；`string` 本地回归（system 行上屏、脚本空模型调用即抛=不入回合、JSONL 0 条目）；`!ok` 展开失败断言（`/demo 缺少必选参数: topic` 走 system 行、JSONL 0 条目） |\n\n`custom-commands.ts` **只消费未修改**（未发现缺陷）。`args.ts / args.test.ts / main.ts` 的 `--max-rounds` 改动原样保留（`grep` 计数 4/8/1 处）。\n\n### 测试结果\n- `bun test packages/tui`：**520 pass / 0 fail**（含 BI-30.1 新 3 条；`agent-tui.test.ts` 15/15）\n- `bun test packages/core`：**2735 pass / 4 fail**\n- 合计 **3259 tests：3255 pass / 4 fail**；`custom-commands.test.ts` 26/26 绿\n- `tsc --noEmit -p packages/tui/tsconfig.json` = **0**；`tsc --noEmit -p packages/core/tsconfig.json` = **0**\n\n### 遗留问题\n1. **4 条失败为环境性既有失败，与本工单无关**：`e2e-drill`（链4 xlsx_audit / 链5 研报组装）与 `os-sandbox`（真实 landlock / bwrap 内核拦截）——我已用 `git stash` 把工作树退到纯净 HEAD 复跑，同样 4 fail（29 pass/4 fail），确认非本次改动引入；本机无 bwrap、landlock 未生效、drill 依赖 Python xlsx 链路。\n2. **共享工作树有并发实例（BI-30.3 主控线）**：正在改 `args.ts/args.test.ts/main.ts/headless(.test).ts`。我为验证既有失败做过一次 `git stash push/pop`，pop 因并发方在窗口期写入 `args.ts`（新增 BI-30.3 `OutputFormat = \"stream-json\" | \"text\"`）而中止——**已完整恢复**：其余 5 文件从 stash 还原并取消误入的 index 暂存，`args.ts` = 原 `--max-rounds` 版 + 并发方 BI-30.3 hunk（`/tmp/bi30-backup/` 留有原件备份），stash 已 drop，`git status` 中其改动全部在列、未回滚。并发方随后又自行推进了 `args.test.ts/headless.ts/headless.test.ts`，属其在途工作，我未触碰。\n3. 中途曾见 `BI-26.3 并发会话`、`BI-20.2 args` 瞬时失败，均因并发方编辑中的半成态；复跑后分别为 252/252、19/19 绿。"}]},"createdAt":1792384512200,"seq":92}}
docs/dogfood/2026-10-19-BI-30/transcripts/01a15269-9c3d-7334-821d-5b40885856d3.jsonl:5:{"kind":"entry","v":1,"entry":{"id":"01a15269-a6eb-705c-9969-98b31e7d1a1d","parentId":"01a15269-a6e9-71ea-823e-79c0503f8028","type":"tool_result","payload":{"ok":true,"value":"/**\n * BI-20.2 —— 全局参数矩阵定义与解析器（只做定义与解析，不做消费接线）。\n *\n * kimi 对应物: apps/kimi-code/src/cli/sub/args.ts（全局旗标面）\n * 差异边界:\n *   - 本卡仅提供 GLOBAL_ARGS 矩阵 + parseGlobalArgs 纯解析器；解析结果的\n *     消费（--agent-file 加载 agent 定义、--add-dir 注入可访问目录、\n *     --prompt 无头启动、--output-format 流式输出）归属 BI-20.1 / 后续装配方；\n *   - 仅支持长参：`--flag value` 与 `--flag=value` 两种传值形式；不支持\n *     短参捆绑；单值 flag 重复出现 → duplicate-flag；可重复 flag（--add-dir）\n *     聚合为数组；\n *   - 结构化错误：unknown-flag / missing-value / invalid-value / duplicate-flag；\n *   - 空格传值时，后随以 `-` 开头的 token 视为缺值（需要 `-` 开头的字面值\n *     请用等号形式，如 `--prompt=--continue`）；单独 `-` 同理视为缺值；\n *   - `--` 之后一律视为位置参数；裸位置参数（如子命令名）收进 positionals，\n *     子命令派发归属装配方，不在本解析器报错。\n */\n\nexport interface GlobalArgSpec {\n  /** 长参名（含前导 --）。 */\n  flag: string;\n  /** 值占位说明（如 \"<path.md>\"）。 */\n  valueName: string;\n  /** 一句话说明（帮助渲染用）。 */\n  description: string;\n  /** 是否可重复出现（重复时聚合为数组）。 */\n  repeatable: boolean;\n  /** 合法值白名单；缺省不校验值域。 */\n  allowedValues?: readonly string[];\n}\n\n/** 全局参数矩阵（合约定义；消费接线归属 BI-20.1 / 后续装配方）。 */\nexport const GLOBAL_ARGS: readonly GlobalArgSpec[] = [\n  {\n    flag: \"--agent-file\",\n    valueName: \"<path.md>\",\n    description: \"agent 定义文件（markdown）路径\",\n    repeatable: false,\n  },\n  {\n    flag: \"--add-dir\",\n    valueName: \"<dir>\",\n    description: \"附加可访问工作目录（可多次出现）\",\n    repeatable: true,\n  },\n  {\n    flag: \"--prompt\",\n    valueName: \"<text>\",\n    description: \"无头模式提示词\",\n    repeatable: false,\n  },\n  {\n    flag: \"--output-format\",\n    valueName: \"<format>\",\n    description: \"输出格式\",\n    repeatable: false,\n    allowedValues: [\"stream-json\"],\n  },\n  {\n    flag: \"--max-rounds\",\n    valueName: \"<n>\",\n    description: \"无头会话模型回合上限（正整数，缺省 8）\",\n    repeatable: false,\n  },\n];\n\nexport type OutputFormat = \"stream-json\";\n\nexport interface ParsedArgs {\n  /** --agent-file 的值。 */\n  agentFile?: string;\n  /** --add-dir 聚合值（保持出现顺序）。 */\n  addDirs: string[];\n  /** --prompt 的值。 */\n  prompt?: string;\n  /** --output-format 的值（已过白名单校验）。 */\n  outputFormat?: OutputFormat;\n  /** --max-rounds 的值（已过正整数校验；缺省回合上限由 headless 决定）。 */\n  maxRounds?: number;\n  /** 位置参数（`--` 后或裸词；子命令派发归属装配方）。 */\n  positionals: string[];\n}\n\nexport type ArgErrorCode = \"unknown-flag\" | \"missing-value\" | \"invalid-value\" | \"duplicate-flag\";\n\nexport class ArgParseError extends Error {\n  constructor(\n    readonly code: ArgErrorCode,\n    message: string,\n    readonly flag?: string,\n  ) {\n    super(message);\n    this.name = \"ArgParseError\";\n  }\n}\n\n/** 解析全局参数矩阵；未知/缺值/非法值/重复单值均抛结构化 ArgParseError。 */\nexport function parseGlobalArgs(argv: readonly string[]): ParsedArgs {\n  const specs = new Map(GLOBAL_ARGS.map((spec) => [spec.flag, spec]));\n  const result: ParsedArgs = { addDirs: [], positionals: [] };\n  const seen = new Set<string>();\n  let afterDoubleDash = false;\n\n  let i = 0;\n  while (i < argv.length) {\n    const token = argv[i];\n    i += 1;\n    if (token === undefined) break; // noUncheckedIndexedAccess 防御\n\n    if (afterDoubleDash) {\n      result.positionals.push(token);\n      continue;\n    }\n    if (token === \"--\") {\n      afterDoubleDash = true;\n      continue;\n    }\n    if (!token.startsWith(\"--\")) {\n      result.positionals.push(token); // 裸词（子命令名等），派发归属装配方\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    let flag = token;\n    let inlineValue: string | undefined;\n    const eq = token.indexOf(\"=\");\n    if (eq !== -1) {\n      flag = token.slice(0, eq);\n      inlineValue = token.slice(eq + 1);\n    }\n\n    const spec = specs.get(flag);\n    if (spec === undefined) {\n      throw new ArgParseError(\n        \"unknown-flag\",\n        `未知参数: ${flag}（支持: ${GLOBAL_ARGS.map((s) => s.flag).join(\" \")}）`,\n        flag,\n      );\n    }\n    if (!spec.repeatable && seen.has(flag)) {\n      throw new ArgParseError(\"duplicate-flag\", `参数重复: ${flag}（该参数只允许出现一次）`, flag);\n    }\n    seen.add(flag);\n\n    let value = inlineValue;\n    if (value === undefined) {\n      const next = argv[i];\n      if (next === undefined || next.startsWith(\"-\")) {\n        throw new ArgParseError(\n          \"missing-value\",\n          `参数 ${flag} 缺少值（需要 ${spec.valueName}）`,\n          flag,\n        );\n      }\n      value = next;\n      i += 1;\n    }\n\n    if (spec.allowedValues !== undefined && !spec.allowedValues.includes(value)) {\n      throw new ArgParseError(\n        \"invalid-value\",\n        `参数 ${flag} 的值非法: ${value}（允许: ${spec.allowedValues.join(\" | \")}）`,\n        flag,\n      );\n    }\n\n    if (spec.flag === \"--agent-file\") result.agentFile = value;\n    else if (spec.flag === \"--add-dir\") result.addDirs.push(value);\n    else if (spec.flag === \"--prompt\") result.prompt = value;\n    else if (spec.flag === \"--output-format\") result.outputFormat = value as OutputFormat;\n    else if (spec.flag === \"--max-rounds\") {\n      if (!/^[1-9]\\d*$/.test(value)) {\n        throw new ArgParseError(\"invalid-value\", `参数 --max-rounds 的值非法: ${value}（需要正整数）`, \"--max-rounds\");\n      }\n      result.maxRounds = Number(value);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return result;\n}\n"},"createdAt":1792384018155,"seq":4,"toolCallId":"call_9b11b0f1c6194dfdb38ba6d8","toolName":"read_file"}}
docs/dogfood/2026-10-19-BI-30/transcripts/01a15269-9c3d-7334-821d-5b40885856d3.jsonl:17:{"kind":"entry","v":1,"entry":{"id":"01a15269-b74b-7a19-a475-4c41e736dbb3","parentId":"01a15269-b747-7201-839f-8002f41a465b","type":"tool_result","payload":{"ok":true,"value":"/**\n * BI-20.2 · 全局参数矩阵 parseGlobalArgs 测试。\n *\n * 覆盖：四个长参（空格/等号传值）、--add-dir 可重复聚合、-- 终止符、\n * 裸位置参数收集、未知参数/缺值（末尾与后随 flag/单独 -）/非法值/\n * 重复单值 flag 的结构化报错、GLOBAL_ARGS 矩阵定义完整性。\n */\nimport { describe, expect, test } from \"bun:test\";\nimport { ArgParseError, GLOBAL_ARGS, parseGlobalArgs } from \"./args\";\n\nfunction catchCode(run: () => unknown): { code: ArgParseError[\"code\"]; flag?: string } {\n  try {\n    run();\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof ArgParseError) return { code: error.code, flag: error.flag };\n    throw error;\n  }\n  throw new Error(\"预期解析失败，但成功了\");\n}\n\ndescribe(\"BI-20.2 parseGlobalArgs：正常解析\", () => {\n  test(\"四个长参空格传值全解析\", () => {\n    const parsed = parseGlobalArgs([\n      \"--agent-file\",\n      \"agents/bi.md\",\n      \"--add-dir\",\n      \"/tmp/x\",\n      \"--prompt\",\n      \"帮我看看\",\n      \"--output-format\",\n      \"stream-json\",\n    ]);\n    expect(parsed.agentFile).toBe(\"agents/bi.md\");\n    expect(parsed.addDirs).toEqual([\"/tmp/x\"]);\n    expect(parsed.prompt).toBe(\"帮我看看\");\n    expect(parsed.outputFormat).toBe(\"stream-json\");\n    expect(parsed.positionals).toEqual([]);\n  });\n\n  test(\"等号形式传值\", () => {\n    const parsed = parseGlobalArgs([\"--agent-file=a.md\", \"--prompt=你好\"]);\n    expect(parsed.agentFile).toBe(\"a.md\");\n    expect(parsed.prompt).toBe(\"你好\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"--add-dir 可重复出现并按顺序聚合\", () => {\n    const parsed = parseGlobalArgs([\"--add-dir\", \"/a\", \"--add-dir=/b\", \"--add-dir\", \"/c\"]);\n    expect(parsed.addDirs).toEqual([\"/a\", \"/b\", \"/c\"]);\n  });\n\n  test(\"裸位置参数收集进 positionals（子命令派发归属装配方）\", () => {\n    const parsed = parseGlobalArgs([\"init\", \"--prompt\", \"p\"]);\n    expect(parsed.positionals).toEqual([\"init\"]);\n    expect(parsed.prompt).toBe(\"p\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"-- 终止符之后全部视为位置参数\", () => {\n    const parsed = parseGlobalArgs([\"--\", \"x\", \"--prompt\", \"-y\"]);\n    expect(parsed.positionals).toEqual([\"x\", \"--prompt\", \"-y\"]);\n    expect(parsed.prompt).toBeUndefined();\n  });\n\n  test(\"空 argv → 空结果\", () => {\n    expect(parseGlobalArgs([])).toEqual({ addDirs: [], positionals: [] });\n  });\n\n  test(\"等号形式可传 `-` 开头的字面值\", () => {\n    const parsed = parseGlobalArgs([\"--prompt=--continue\"]);\n    expect(parsed.prompt).toBe(\"--continue\");\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe(\"BI-20.2 parseGlobalArgs：结构化报错\", () => {\n  test(\"未知参数 → unknown-flag（flag 字段回传参名）\", () => {\n    const { code, flag } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\"--unknown\"]));\n    expect(code).toBe(\"unknown-flag\");\n    expect(flag).toBe(\"--unknown\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"末尾缺值 → missing-value\", () => {\n    const { code, flag } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\"--agent-file\"]));\n    expect(code).toBe(\"missing-value\");\n    expect(flag).toBe(\"--agent-file\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"后随另一 flag 视为缺值 → missing-value\", () => {\n    const { code, flag } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\"--prompt\", \"--add-dir\", \"/x\"]));\n    expect(code).toBe(\"missing-value\");\n    expect(flag).toBe(\"--prompt\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"后随单独 `-` 视为缺值 → missing-value\", () => {\n    const { code } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\"--prompt\", \"-\"]));\n    expect(code).toBe(\"missing-value\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"--output-format 非法值 → invalid-value\", () => {\n    const { code, flag } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\"--output-format\", \"text\"]));\n    expect(code).toBe(\"invalid-value\");\n    expect(flag).toBe(\"--output-format\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"--output-format 合法值 stream-json 通过\", () => {\n    expect(parseGlobalArgs([\"--output-format=stream-json\"]).outputFormat).toBe(\"stream-json\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"单值 flag 重复出现 → duplicate-flag\", () => {\n    const { code, flag } = catchCode(() =>\n      parseGlobalArgs([\"--prompt\", \"a\", \"--prompt\", \"b\"]),\n    );\n    expect(code).toBe(\"duplicate-flag\");\n    expect(flag).toBe(\"--prompt\");\n  });\n\n  test(\"可重复 flag（--add-dir）重复不报 duplicate-flag\", () => {\n    expect(parseGlobalArgs([\"--add-dir\", \"/a\", \"--add-dir\", \"/b\"]).addDirs).toEqual([\"/a\", \"/b\"]);\n  });\n\n  test(\"--max-rounds 正整数通过并转 number\", () => {\n    expect(parseGlobalArgs([\"--max-rounds\", \"24\"]).maxRounds).toBe(24);\n    expect(parseGlobalArgs([\"--max-rounds=1\"]).maxRounds).toBe(1);\n  });\n\n  test(\"--max-rounds 非正整数 → invalid-value\", () => {\n    // 负数以 \"-\" 开头,按既有契约走 missing-value（与 --prompt 遇 \"-\" 同规）。\n    const { code } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\"--max-rounds\", \"-3\"]));\n    expect(code).toBe(\"missing-value\");\n    for (const bad of [\"0\", \"2.5\", \"abc\"]) {\n      const { code, flag } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\"--max-rounds\", bad]));\n      expect(code).toBe(\"invalid-value\");\n      expect(flag).toBe(\"--max-rounds\");\n    }\n  });\n});\n\ndescribe(\"BI-20.2 GLOBAL_ARGS：矩阵定义完整性\", () => {\n  test(\"包含五个合约旗标且定义字段齐备\", () => {\n    expect(GLOBAL_ARGS.map((s) => s.flag)).toEqual([\n      \"--agent-file\",\n      \"--add-dir\",\n      \"--prompt\",\n      \"--output-format\",\n      \"--max-rounds\",\n    ]);\n    for (const spec of GLOBAL_ARGS) {\n      expect(spec.flag.startsWith(\"--\")).toBe(true);\n      expect(spec.valueName.length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\n      expect(spec.description.length).toBeGreaterThan(0);\n      expect(typeof spec.repeatable).toBe(\"boolean\");\n    }\n  });\n\n  test(\"可重复性与值域约束按合约定义\", () => {\n    const byFlag = new Map(GLOBAL_ARGS.map((s) => [s.flag, s]));\n    expect(byFlag.get(\"--add-dir\")?.repeatable).toBe(true);\n    expect(byFlag.get(\"--agent-file\")?.repeatable).toBe(false);\n    expect(byFlag.get(\"--prompt\")?.repeatable).toBe(false);\n    expect(byFlag.get(\"--output-format\")?.allowedValues).toEqual([\"stream-json\"]);\n    expect(byFlag.get(\"--agent-file\")?.valueName).toBe(\"<path.md>\");\n  });\n});\n"},"createdAt":1792384022347,"seq":16,"toolCallId":"call_a703883f2a644d5f8432482d","toolName":"read_file"}}
docs/dogfood/2026-10-19-BI-30/transcripts/01a15269-9c3d-7334-821d-5b40885856d3.jsonl:24:{"kind":"entry","v":1,"entry":{"id":"01a15269-c430-7fc3-806a-2ef815595c10","parentId":"01a15269-c42a-7032-b325-fd05f45cda39","type":"tool_result","payload":{"ok":true,"value":"{\"count\":18,\"output\":\"packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:30:      \\\"--output-format\\\",\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:36:    expect(parsed.outputFormat).toBe(\\\"stream-json\\\");\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:97:  test(\\\"--output-format 非法值 → invalid-value\\\", () => {\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:98:    const { code, flag } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\\\"--output-format\\\", \\\"text\\\"]));\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:100:    expect(flag).toBe(\\\"--output-format\\\");\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:103:  test(\\\"--output-format 合法值 stream-json 通过\\\", () => {\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:104:    expect(parseGlobalArgs([\\\"--output-format=stream-json\\\"]).outputFormat).toBe(\\\"stream-json\\\");\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:142:      \\\"--output-format\\\",\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts:158:    expect(byFlag.get(\\\"--output-format\\\")?.allowedValues).toEqual([\\\"stream-json\\\"]);\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts:8: *     --prompt 无头启动、--output-format 流式输出）归属 BI-20.1 / 后续装配方；\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts:53:    flag: \\\"--output-format\\\",\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts:67:export type OutputFormat = \\\"stream-json\\\";\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts:76:  /** --output-format 的值（已过白名单校验）。 */\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts:77:  outputFormat?: OutputFormat;\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts:169:    else if (spec.flag === \\\"--output-format\\\") result.outputFormat = value as OutputFormat;\\npackages/core/src/cli/commands/dispatch.ts:150:const GLOBAL_FLAG_NAMES: readonly string[] = [\\\"--agent-file\\\", \\\"--add-dir\\\", \\\"--prompt\\\", \\\"--output-format\\\"];\\npackages/core/src/cli/headless.test.ts:260:\\t\\t\\tconst code = await runBi([\\\"--prompt\\\", \\\"你好\\\", \\\"--output-format\\\", \\\"stream-json\\\"], {\\npackages/core/src/cli/main.ts:45:  bi --prompt \\\"<text>\\\" [--output-format stream-json]   无头会话（骨架真实路径）\"}"},"createdAt":1792384025648,"seq":23,"toolCallId":"call_b5d3ef564bdd495784ca6498","toolName":"grep"}}
docs/dogfood/2026-10-19-BI-30/transcripts/01a15269-9c3d-7334-821d-5b40885856d3.jsonl:34:{"kind":"entry","v":1,"entry":{"id":"01a15269-e162-754f-bd57-f96256fff218","parentId":"01a15269-e15e-757f-874d-116a33ee0932","type":"tool_result","payload":{"ok":true,"value":"{\"exitCode\":0,\"output\":\"diff --git a/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts b/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts\\nindex a98d0ed..6666f49 100644\\n--- a/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts\\n+++ b/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.test.ts\\n@@ -115,15 +115,32 @@ describe(\\\"BI-20.2 parseGlobalArgs：结构化报错\\\", () => {\\n   test(\\\"可重复 flag（--add-dir）重复不报 duplicate-flag\\\", () => {\\n     expect(parseGlobalArgs([\\\"--add-dir\\\", \\\"/a\\\", \\\"--add-dir\\\", \\\"/b\\\"]).addDirs).toEqual([\\\"/a\\\", \\\"/b\\\"]);\\n   });\\n+\\n+  test(\\\"--max-rounds 正整数通过并转 number\\\", () => {\\n+    expect(parseGlobalArgs([\\\"--max-rounds\\\", \\\"24\\\"]).maxRounds).toBe(24);\\n+    expect(parseGlobalArgs([\\\"--max-rounds=1\\\"]).maxRounds).toBe(1);\\n+  });\\n+\\n+  test(\\\"--max-rounds 非正整数 → invalid-value\\\", () => {\\n+    // 负数以 \\\"-\\\" 开头,按既有契约走 missing-value（与 --prompt 遇 \\\"-\\\" 同规）。\\n+    const { code } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\\\"--max-rounds\\\", \\\"-3\\\"]));\\n+    expect(code).toBe(\\\"missing-value\\\");\\n+    for (const bad of [\\\"0\\\", \\\"2.5\\\", \\\"abc\\\"]) {\\n+      const { code, flag } = catchCode(() => parseGlobalArgs([\\\"--max-rounds\\\", bad]));\\n+      expect(code).toBe(\\\"invalid-value\\\");\\n+      expect(flag).toBe(\\\"--max-rounds\\\");\\n+    }\\n+  });\\n });\\n \\n describe(\\\"BI-20.2 GLOBAL_ARGS：矩阵定义完整性\\\", () => {\\n-  test(\\\"包含四个合约旗标且定义字段齐备\\\", () => {\\n+  test(\\\"包含五个合约旗标且定义字段齐备\\\", () => {\\n     expect(GLOBAL_ARGS.map((s) => s.flag)).toEqual([\\n       \\\"--agent-file\\\",\\n       \\\"--add-dir\\\",\\n       \\\"--prompt\\\",\\n       \\\"--output-format\\\",\\n+      \\\"--max-rounds\\\",\\n     ]);\\n     for (const spec of GLOBAL_ARGS) {\\n       expect(spec.flag.startsWith(\\\"--\\\")).toBe(true);\\ndiff --git a/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts b/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts\\nindex 7edb410..ad49901 100644\\n--- a/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts\\n+++ b/packages/core/src/cli/commands/args.ts\\n@@ -56,6 +56,12 @@ export const GLOBAL_ARGS: readonly GlobalArgSpec[] = [\\n     repeatable: false,\\n     allowedValues: [\\\"stream-json\\\"],\\n   },\\n+  {\\n+    flag: \\\"--max-rounds\\\",\\n+    valueName: \\\"<n>\\\",\\n+    description: \\\"无头会话模型回合上限（正整数，缺省 8）\\\",\\n+    repeatable: false,\\n+  },\\n ];\\n \\n export type OutputFormat = \\\"stream-json\\\";\\n@@ -69,6 +75,8 @@ export interface ParsedArgs {\\n   prompt?: string;\\n   /** --output-format 的值（已过白名单校验）。 */\\n   outputFormat?: OutputFormat;\\n+  /** --max-rounds 的值（已过正整数校验；缺省回合上限由 headless 决定）。 */\\n+  maxRounds?: number;\\n   /** 位置参数（`--` 后或裸词；子命令派发归属装配方）。 */\\n   positionals: string[];\\n }\\n@@ -159,6 +167,12 @@ export function parseGlobalArgs(argv: readonly string[]): ParsedArgs {\\n     else if (spec.flag === \\\"--add-dir\\\") result.addDirs.push(value);\\n     else if (spec.flag === \\\"--prompt\\\") result.prompt = value;\\n     else if (spec.flag === \\\"--output-format\\\") result.outputFormat = value as OutputFormat;\\n+    else if (spec.flag === \\\"--max-rounds\\\") {\\n+      if (!/^[1-9]\\\\d*$/.test(value)) {\\n+        throw new ArgParseError(\\\"invalid-value\\\", `参数 --max-rounds 的值非法: ${value}（需要正整数）`, \\\"--max-rounds\\\");\\n+      }\\n+      result.maxRounds = Number(value);\\n+    }\\n   }\\n \\n   return result;\\ndiff --git a/packages/core/src/cli/main.ts b/packages/core/src/cli/main.ts\\nindex f5c9048..78ab216 100644\\n--- a/packages/core/src/cli/main.ts\\n+++ b/packages/core/src/cli/main.ts\\n@@ -174,7 +174,10 @@ export async function runBi(argv: readonly string[], options: RunBiOptions = {})\\n \\t\\t\\t...(configGate !== undefined ? { gate: configGate } : {}),\\n \\t\\t\\t...(h.trust !== undefined ? { trust: h.trust } : {}),\\n \\t\\t\\t...(h.hookSpawn !== undefined ? { hookSpawn: h.hookSpawn } : {}),\\n-\\t\\t\\t...(h.maxRounds !== undefined ? { maxRounds: h.maxRounds } : {}),\\n+\\t\\t\\t// CLI --max-rounds 优先于 deps 透传（BI-30 dogfood 发现：真实工单 8 回合不够）。\\n+\\t\\t\\t...((parsed.maxRounds ?? h.maxRounds) !== undefined\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t? { maxRounds: parsed.maxRounds ?? h.maxRounds }\\n+\\t\\t\\t\\t: {}),\\n \\t\\t\\t...(options.out !== undefined ? { out: options.out } : {}),\\n \\t\\t});\\n \\t\\treturn result.exitCode;\\n\"}"},"createdAt":1792384033122,"seq":33,"toolCallId":"call_89fa54c12c42424c82cbb2d2","toolName":"bash"}}
docs/dogfood/2026-10-19-BI-30/transcripts/01a15269-9c3d-7334-821d-5b40885856d3.jsonl:37:{"kind":"entry","v":1,"entry":{"id":"01a15269-ef79-73d2-b3c8-8cd49d582d41","parentId":"01a15269-ef75-70ac-b0f5-b07707d3d7e5","type":"tool_result","payload":{"ok":true,"value":"#!/usr/bin/env bun\n/**\n * bi 真入口：BI-20.2 建立、BI-23.1 接 main 分发、BI-24.2 接 REPL 主路径。\n *\n * 装配序（kimi 装配参考 main→cli→tui 段）：\n * - 无参 = 交互 REPL：配置装配（三级 TOML+env）→ BI-02 凭据门 → BI-04.2 真实\n *   驱动 → AgentTuiSession（writer=stdout）→ runRepl（InputLoop→KeyStream 真实桥）；\n *   凭据/配置失败结构化退出码 3（与 headless 同一面）。\n * - 带参 = runBi 全局分发（--version/--help/--prompt 无头/八子命令，BI-24.1）。\n */\nimport { ConfigService } from \"../packages/core/src/config/config-service\";\nimport { ConfigError } from \"../packages/core/src/config/schema\";\nimport { resolveModelPort, ModelPortConfigError } from \"../packages/core/src/cli/model-port\";\nimport { buildDefaultToolset } from \"../packages/core/src/cli/toolset\";\nimport { runBi } from \"../packages/core/src/cli/main\";\nimport { AgentTuiSession, MOUSE_DISABLE, MOUSE_ENABLE } from \"../packages/tui/src/mount/agent-tui\";\nimport { KeyStream, runRepl } from \"../packages/tui/src/mount/repl\";\nimport { InputLoop } from \"../packages/tui/src/engine/diff-renderer\";\nimport { PermissionGate } from \"../packages/core/src/guard/permission-gate\";\nimport { permissionModeFromConfig, PermissionSessionController } from \"../packages/core/src/cli/permission-mode\";\nimport {\n  PERMISSIONS_USAGE,\n  permissionsCommand,\n} from \"../packages/core/src/cli/commands/permissions-command\";\nimport {\n\tdiscoverSlashCommands,\n\texpandCommand,\n\tslashCommandSurface,\n\ttype SlashCommand,\n} from \"../packages/core/src/commands/custom-commands\";\nimport { homedir } from \"node:os\";\nimport { join } from \"node:path\";\nimport { readFile, readdir } from \"node:fs/promises\";\n\nimport { builtinSlashCandidates } from \"../packages/tui/src/mount/candidate-menu\";\n\ntype RawCapableStdin = AsyncIterable<Uint8Array> & { isTTY?: boolean; setRawMode?: (on: boolean) => void };\n\n/** BI-27.4 内置候选兜底(tui 命令面最小集;发现失败/空目录时仍可用)。 */\nconst builtinFallback = builtinSlashCandidates;\n\n/** 交互 REPL 主路径（bin 层装配；REPL v1 纯对话，工具注册表面归后续装配卡）。 */\nasync function runReplMain(stdin: RawCapableStdin): Promise<number> {\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst service = new ConfigService();\n\t\tconst config = await service.load();\n\t\tconst selection = resolveModelPort(config, {\n\t\t\tresolveApiKey: (name) => service.resolveProviderApiKey(name),\n\t\t});\n\t\tprocess.stderr.write(`bi: 模型已装配 provider=${selection.providerName} mode=${selection.mode} model=${selection.wireModel}\\n`);\n\n\t\t// BI-28.3 接线:权限面单实例——config [permission] mode/rules 建门禁(规则\n\t\t// 缺 scope 补 always),控制器喂 /permissions 命令面;工具回路与命令面共享。\n\t\tconst gate = new PermissionGate({ mode: permissionModeFromConfig(config.permission?.mode) });\n// config 规则的 ask 动作 = 缺省语义,门禁静态层(allow/deny)不表,装配时剔除\n\t\tconst staticRules: PermissionRule[] = [];\n\t\tfor (const rule of config.permission?.rules ?? []) {\n\t\t\tif (rule.action === \"ask\") continue;\n\t\t\tstaticRules.push({ tool: rule.tool, pattern: rule.pattern, action: rule.action, scope: \"always\" });\n\t\t}\n\t\tgate.addRules(staticRules);\n\t\tconst controller = new PermissionSessionController({ gate });\n\n\t\t// BI-27.4 接线:自定义斜杠命令入候选菜单(内置 + ~/.bi/commands + <cwd>/.bi/commands);\n\t\t// 发现失败退回内置候选,不影响 REPL 启动。\n\t\t// BI-30.1:完整命令注册表(SlashCommand[])保留——补全面取 name/description\n\t\t// 子集,执行面按名取命令对象喂 expandCommand;发现失败 = 空注册表。\n\t\tlet customCommands: readonly SlashCommand[] = [];\n\t\tlet menuCandidates: ReadonlyArray<{ name: string; description: string }> = [];\n\t\ttry {\n\t\t\tconst commandFs = {\n\t\t\t\treaddir: async (path: string): Promise<string[]> => {\n\t\t\t\t\tconst entries = await readdir(path, { withFileTypes: true });\n\t\t\t\t\treturn entries.filter((e) => e.isFile()).map((e) => e.name);\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t\treadFile: async (path: string): Promise<string> => readFile(path, \"utf8\"),\n\t\t\t};\n\t\t\tconst discovered = await discoverSlashCommands(\n\t\t\t\t[join(homedir(), \".bi\", \"commands\"), join(process.cwd(), \".bi\", \"commands\")],\n\t\t\t\tcommandFs,\n\t\t\t);\n\t\t\tcustomCommands = discovered.commands; // 完整注册表(执行面用,不只 surface 条目)\n\t\t\tmenuCandidates = [...slashCommandSurface(discovered.commands), ...builtinFallback];\n\t\t} catch {\n\t\t\tcustomCommands = [];\n\t\t\tmenuCandidates = [...builtinFallback];\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t// 斜杠命令执行面(BI-30.1;/permissions 归 BI-28.3):返回两形态——\n\t\t// - 已知自定义命令 → expandCommand(命令对象, 参数数组):\n\t\t//     ok → { prompt: 展开文本 } = 展开后的用户提示词,入模型回合;\n\t\t//     !ok → error.message = 本地错误文本(不入模型回合);\n\t\t// - /permissions 与未知命令:语义不变(本地文本回执,不入模型回合)。\n\t\tconst slashCommand = async (line: string): Promise<string | { prompt: string }> => {\n\t\t\tconst trimmed = line.trim();\n\t\t\tconst head = trimmed.split(/\\s+/)[0] ?? \"\";\n\t\t\tif (head === \"/permissions\") {\n\t\t\t\t// parse 吃的是去前缀参数体(\"/permissions\" 本身不入参)\n\t\t\t\tconst body = trimmed.replace(/^\\/permissions\\b/, \"\").trim();\n\t\t\t\tconst parsed = permissionsCommand.parse(body);\n\t\t\t\tif (!parsed.ok) return `${parsed.error.message}\\n用法: ${PERMISSIONS_USAGE}`;\n\t\t\t\treturn permissionsCommand.execute(parsed.args, controller.toPorts()).join(\"\\n\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst command = customCommands.find((c) => `/${c.name}` === head);\n\t\t\tif (command !== undefined) {\n\t\t\t\t// 参数体 = 去命令头后的余下文本,按空白切分喂位置参数($1..$n/$ARGUMENTS)。\n\t\t\t\tconst rest = trimmed.slice(head.length).trim();\n\t\t\t\tconst argv = rest === \"\" ? [] : rest.split(/\\s+/);\n\t\t\t\tconst expanded = expandCommand(command, argv);\n\t\t\t\treturn expanded.ok ? { prompt: expanded.text } : expanded.error.message;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst known = menuCandidates.some((c) => `/${c.name}` === head);\n\t\t\treturn known\n\t\t\t\t? `斜杠命令 ${head} 的执行面尚未接线(内置候选,执行归后续卡)。`\n\t\t\t\t: `未知斜杠命令: ${head}(可用: /permissions)`;\n\t\t};\n\n\t\tconst session = new AgentTuiSession({\n\t\t\tmodel: selection.port,\n\t\t\ttools: buildDefaultToolset(process.cwd()),\n\t\t\tcwd: process.cwd(),\n\t\t\tgate,\n\t\t\tcandidates: () => menuCandidates,\n\t\t\tslashCommand,\n\t\t\t// 真实终端尺寸（BI-24.3）：此前缺省 24×80，大终端上提示符钉在第 24 行、\n\t\t\t// 转录画在第 1 行，画面与视口脱节。\n\t\t\trows: process.stdout.rows ?? 24,\n\t\t\tcols: process.stdout.columns ?? 80,\n\t\t\twriter: { write: (data) => process.stdout.write(data) },\n\t\t});\n\t\tconst keys = new KeyStream();\n\t\t// 终端尺寸变更跟随（SIGWINCH；非 TTY 无事件，保守注册）。\n\t\tprocess.on(\"SIGWINCH\", () => {\n\t\t\tsession.resize(process.stdout.rows ?? 24, process.stdout.columns ?? 80);\n\t\t});\n\n\t\t// 真实输入桥：stdin 字节 → InputLoop（粘贴聚合+按键解析）→ KeyStream。\n\t\t// EOF 桥：reader 耗尽（管道关闭/EOF）即 KeyStream.end()——InputLoop 静默\n\t\t// 吞掉 reader 结束，REPL 的 eof 终场需此显式信号。\n\t\tasync function* stdinChunks(): AsyncIterable<Uint8Array> {\n\t\t\ttry {\n\t\t\t\tfor await (const chunk of stdin) yield chunk;\n\t\t\t} finally {\n\t\t\t\tkeys.end();\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tconst loop = new InputLoop(stdinChunks(), (key) => keys.push(key));\n\t\tif (stdin.isTTY === true) {\n\t\t\ttry {\n\t\t\t\tstdin.setRawMode?.(true); // raw-mode 尽力而为；失败退化为行式输入\n\t\t\t\tprocess.stdout.write(MOUSE_ENABLE); // BI-27.5 滚轮历史:SGR 鼠标上报\n\t\t\t} catch {\n\t\t\t\t// 忽略：非交互/受限终端\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t\tloop.start();\n\t\ttry {\n\t\t\tconst result = await runRepl({ session, keys, title: \"bi repl\" });\n\t\t\treturn result.endedAs === \"session-exited\" ? 4 : 0;\n\t\t} finally {\n\t\t\tloop.stop();\n\t\t\tif (stdin.isTTY === true) {\n\t\t\t\ttry {\n\t\t\t\t\tprocess.stdout.write(MOUSE_DISABLE); // 离场还原鼠标语义\n\t\t\t\t\tstdin.setRawMode?.(false);\n\t\t\t\t} catch {\n\t\t\t\t\t// 忽略\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t}\n\t} catch (cause) {\n\t\tif (cause instanceof ConfigError || cause instanceof ModelPortConfigError) {\n\t\t\tprocess.stderr.write(`bi: ${cause.message}\\n`);\n\t\t\treturn 3;\n\t\t}\n\t\tthrow cause;\n\t}\n}\n\nconst argv = process.argv.slice(2);\nprocess.exitCode =\n\targv.length === 0\n\t\t? await runReplMain(process.stdin as RawCapableStdin)\n\t\t: await runBi(argv, { headless: { tools: buildDefaultToolset(process.cwd()) } });\n"},"createdAt":1792384036729,"seq":36,"toolCallId":"cal
